  "post_content": "<p>Esta misma tarde-noche se ha procedido a&nbsp;montar los&nbsp;66 &quot;cadafals&quot; restantes en las calles San Roque y La Safona para completar el recinto taurino para Fira d&#39;Onda, compuesto por un total de 209.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/10/IMG_9226.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ayer se montaron los 143 &quot;cadafals&quot; del Pla y el Raval de Sant Josep y ma&ntilde;ana mi&eacute;rcoles se montar&aacute;n los cajones, adem&aacute;s de subsanar las posibles deficiencias que indiquen los t&eacute;cnicos.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9223.jpg\" alt=\"img_9223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9224.jpg\" alt=\"img_9224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9225.jpg\" alt=\"img_9225\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9226.jpg\" alt=\"img_9226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9227.jpg\" alt=\"img_9227\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9228.jpg\" alt=\"img_9228\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9229.jpg\" alt=\"img_9229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9230.jpg\" alt=\"img_9230\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9231.jpg\" alt=\"img_9231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9232.jpg\" alt=\"img_9232\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9233.jpg\" alt=\"img_9233\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9234.jpg\" alt=\"img_9234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9235.jpg\" alt=\"img_9235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9236.jpg\" alt=\"img_9236\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9237.jpg\" alt=\"img_9237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9238.jpg\" alt=\"img_9238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9239.jpg\" alt=\"img_9239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/montajecadafalssafonasantroc/img_9240.jpg\" alt=\"img_9240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
